  "summary": "The saved mask comes from the self-contained cell C26. It loads region SST (lat indices 48-107, lon indices 353-412) for 1991-12-27..2003-01-05 and 2021-06-01..08-31, builds \u00b15-day Hazen 90th-percentile thresholds per day of year for sea cells, and smooths them with a wrapping 31-day mean. The target days 2021-06-01..08-31 use smoothed days of year 153-244, which draw on pools for days 138-259, i.e. 12 May to 20 Sep of each baseline year. It then compares all 92 target days against these thresholds, finds runs of at least 5 hot days, joins gaps of 1-2 days, and writes the result to output/mhw_mask.nc."
